    "sentence_translations": [
      "Ghost Festivals",
      "",
      "Formerly in China, people thought that people became ghosts after they died.",
      "Ghosts would miss their former families, and they would also help their former family members.",
      "So Chinese ghost festivals are quite different to those in other places.",
      "",
      "China has three ghost festivals. Every year they take place on April 4th or 5th, ..",
      ".. and on the 15th day of the seventh month and the first day of the tenth month of the lunar calendar.",
      "During these festivals, people go to sweep tombs, that is to clean the ghosts’ houses, ..",
      ".. and will also present the ghosts with gifts of food and alcohol.",
      "People say that ghosts will come back and visit their former families on the 15th day of the seventh month.",
      "So Chinese people will also burn ritual money so that their deceased relatives can have money to spend in that world.",
      "In recent years, some people have also burned iPhones, computers, and houses for the ghosts!",
      "",
      "China’s ghost festivals sound very strange.",
      "But this is a way to let yourself remember family members from the past.",
      "This method is a way to cherish the memory of family members who have passed away.",
      ""
    ]
  }
